@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Obtain an antiforgery token. Retain the response cookie and use the token below.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customer-accounts/antiforgery

### Save delivery details as a guest or with a signed-in session.
### Replace the token and include the antiforgery cookie from the request above.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customer-delivery-details
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: replace-with-request-token

{
  "customerCountry": "India",
  "saveToAccount": false,
  "mobileNumber": "1234567890",
  "firstName": "Cricket Fan",
  "addressLine1": "Example Street",
  "receiverPhone": "1234567890",
  "pincode": "560001",
  "state": "Karnataka",
  "city": "Bengaluru",
  "deliveryCountry": "India"
}

### Latest address: requires a signed-in customer session; returns 204 when none exists.
### Set saveToAccount to true when saving an address for a signed-in customer.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customer-delivery-details/latest

### All saved addresses, newest first: requires a signed-in customer session.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customer-delivery-details

### Update an owned saved address. Include the session, antiforgery cookie and request token.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customer-delivery-details/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: replace-with-request-token

{
  "customerCountry": "India",
  "mobileNumber": "1234567890",
  "firstName": "Cricket Fan",
  "addressLine1": "Updated Example Street",
  "receiverPhone": "1234567890",
  "pincode": "560001",
  "state": "Karnataka",
  "city": "Bengaluru",
  "deliveryCountry": "India"
}

### Remove an owned saved address. Include the session, antiforgery cookie and request token.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customer-delivery-details/1
X-CSRF-TOKEN: replace-with-request-token
